see happen in your life?

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:12.413
Is nursing something
you're thinking about?

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:15.270
- Nursing.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:16.293
I like to travel.

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.163
Yeah.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.050
I'll be completely honest.

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.800
What is that biggest mountain?

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.313
It's not Mount Everest,
is it Mount Everest?

00:15:27.447 --> 00:15:28.280
- [Mark] Mount Everest is pretty big.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.910
- The biggest mountain in the world?

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:31.690
- [Mark] In the world?

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:33.960
Might be Kilimanjaro. I'm not sure.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.010
Kilimanjaro might be.

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:37.710
- Well, whatever the biggest one is--

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:38.543
- [Mark] I think Mount
Everest is pretty big.

00:15:38.543 --> 00:15:40.370
- Yeah, pretty sure it's Mount Everest.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.253
But I want to hike that.

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:46.330
And even though that
sounds stupid and crazy,

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:49.140
I remember watching a video
and it is kind of dangerous

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:53.690
but that's like my old grandma
kinda to-do-list, bucket list

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.470
- [Mark] It's good to have dreams.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.860
- And get a car one day.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.963
Oh, and maybe play for the WNBA,

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.890
'cause I've been practicing
basketball a lot,

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.040
and I've been pretty good actually.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:07.880
Even though I still got a
lot to learning to do, but...

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.250
- [Mark] Awesome.

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:12.420
All right Maddie, let's stay in touch

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:14.096
and we'll see where...

00:16:14.096 --> 00:16:14.929
- Okay.

00:16:14.929 --> 00:16:16.343
- [Mark] See what we can do.

00:16:16.343 --> 00:16:17.176
Thanks.

